{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing casual desktop shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the barrel with the left button of the mouse, drag it to the left, follow the direction of the parabola, release the mouse, launch the cute girl to hit the enemy, and defeat the enemy to pass the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roleplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control five girls, each with different professions and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will get gold coins when you pass the level. You can use the gold coins to upgrade the girl, and the upgrade can improve the girl's attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get special currency in the level. Consume 5 special currency to activate new skills for the girl and unlock the girl's CG image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949730?t=1756854016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949730?t=1756854016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949730/ae34e93a1ffc8d435cb86bb00bfac6ef8599b401/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756854016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949730/ae34e93a1ffc8d435cb86bb00bfac6ef8599b401/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756854016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a relaxing casual desktop shooting game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the barrel with the left button of the mouse, drag it to the left, follow the direction of the parabola, release the mouse, launch the cute girl to hit the enemy, and defeat the enemy to pass the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roleplay:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control five girls, each with different professions and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will get gold coins when you pass the level. You can use the gold coins to upgrade the girl, and the upgrade can improve the girl's attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get special currency in the level. Consume 5 special currency to activate new skills for the girl and unlock the girl's CG image.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Another Fire"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949730/a69fe5e18647d55e84a67e78c8595fc80a4562f0/header.jpg?t=1756854016","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257192348,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192348/movie480.mp4?t=1756854014","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192348/movie_max.mp4?t=1756854014"},"name":"\u5ba3\u4f20\u7247","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s